  "description": "Defines the predictive flags for a fan's likelihood of leaving the platform.",
  "definition": "A predictive classification of a fan's likelihood to stop using the platform. 'High' indicates a strong probability of churning soon. 'Medium' indicates a moderate risk. 'Low' indicates a loyal and stable user."
}

